      "content": "It sounds like you are under a lot of pressure, and feeling constantly evaluated can be very stressful. To optimize your performance, start by clearly defining what \"success\" looks like for your specific role and then batch similar tasks to minimize context switching. Create a daily prioritized to-do list, focusing on the high-impact items first to ensure you always deliver on what matters most. This structured approach can help build a visible pattern of consistent, high-quality work for any evaluation.",
